          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "only_once": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "example": false,
          "description": "是否只执行一次。定时触发剧本必填"
        },
        "execution_type": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "PARALLEL",
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n执行队列类型\n- PARALLEL 新任务与之前任务并行\n- SERIAL_WAIT 不发起新任务\n\n**约束限制:**\n定时触发剧本必填\n**取值范围:**\n- PARALLEL\n- SERIAL_WAIT\n\n**默认取值:**\n无",
